// Game portraits start at 1000

// three letter prefix is 2 letters for race and one letter for gender
// the race prefixes are
//	HU - human
//	DW - dwarf
//	EL - elf
//	HE - half elf
//	GN - gnome
//	HA - halfling
//	HO - half orc
//	HG - half ogre

// the gender is M for male and F for female

// Note: This only supports .bmp files right now!

